{
  "_comment": [
    "What the shell looks like. game/presentation.h says what each key means",
    "and why this is a second file beside tuning.json rather than a section of",
    "it. Colours are either a name the engine knows or RRGGBB / RRGGBBAA.",
    "Every key here is read at startup; a missing one stops the game with this",
    "file and the position in it named."
